[ti:Auld Lang Syne]
[ar:Traditional]
[01:00.00]Should auld acquaintance be forgot
[01:00.50]And never brought to mind
[01:01.00]Should auld acquaintance be forgot
[01:01.50]And auld lang syne
[02:30.00]For auld lang syne, my dear
[02:30.50]For auld lang syne
[02:31.00]We'll tak a cup o kindness yet
[02:31.50]For auld lang syne
[03:00.00]And there's a hand my trusty friend
[03:00.50]And gie's a hand o thine
[03:01.00]We'll tak a right gude willie waught
[03:01.50]For auld lang syne
